                                                "sense_id": "547ec571-8810-3895-8c1a-8acd06489c6e",
                                                "text": "He passed a block of bright posters. One of them extolled domestic gas: a smiling toy paraclete called Mr Therm presided over a sort of warm Holy Family."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
